  "description": "This plugin enables automated submission of URLs from your Umbraco site to multiple search engines, without needing to register and verify your site with them. Once installed, the plugin will automatically generate and host the API key on your site. It detects content creation, update, and deletion within Umbraco and automatically submits the URLs to search engines in the background. This ensures search engines always have the latest information about your website.",
